herdr-app
https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app, at b721deda985270ec8256552692729a4add389b2a
License: Apache-2.0 (full text in licenses/Apache-2.0.txt)

Adapted here, and changed:
- ghostty-sys/build.rs and ghostty-sys/src/lib.rs, from crates/ghostty-sys: the
  Ghostty source path points at vendor/ghostty.
- terminal/src/vt.rs, from src/vt.rs: cut to the screen, cursor, scrollback, colours
  and the key and mouse encoders; search, selection, links and images are left out;
  frames are read as rows of cells for Rune to draw.
